00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:45.830
Er, I mean, Kazuya is gone!

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:48.940
Oh, gosh! He's so irresponsible, leaving his friends like that!

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:49.990
Oh, no!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:56.710
H...Hey, Kasuga!

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:58.580
What's up with Oniichan?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.750
Bumble, Bumble! Bumble, Bumble!
Bumble, Bumble!

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:02.200
Jingoro!

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.600
Hey, Kazuya! Where did Jingoro go?!

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:16.070
Hey, Kazuya! Will you help me out a little?!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.120
Madoka's cat?

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:20.680
What?

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:23.650
Oh, er... that was, y'see...
What?

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:28.280
...my mommy!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.120
What?! Er... just what's going on here?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.960
Yesterday, quite by accident,
while I was out shopping, I saw her!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:39.730
There's no doubt about it!

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:52.840
"Jingoro! What's wrong?!"

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.250
Please! Tell me! Where did she go?!

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:03.300
"Tell me?" Um... I've got no idea what's going on here, you know what I mean?

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:07.230
Well, if you're looking for Madoka, then...
she called earlier and said...

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:13.160
Why, you, Jingoro! Where'd you go?!
I've been looking everywhere for you!

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:29.110
So what's the story?! Are you telling us
that the cat's owner is here?

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.310
What a cute one.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:52.640
My! Two pussycats at that.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.600
Madoka...

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:05.200
So, you're the one... the weirdo who lets us take care of his cat...

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.920
...and then accuses us of stealing her.

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:13.410
We sure would like a little gratitude for finding her!

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:16.970
What you did was despicable!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:19.060
You won't get away with this.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:30.020
"I hear they are a shady bunch of fellows."

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.160
"If I recall... they hang out just outside of town."

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:33.740
"So, what happened to Ayukawa?!"

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.430
"Oh! Oh, she went with Hikaru!"

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:37.420
"What?! Hikaru too?!"

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.990
Mommy!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:29.400
Such an energetic pussycat.

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:38.610
"Puttytat, Puttytat...
won't you be my... friend?"

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:57.440
If you thought that all the girls these days would...

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.280
...be so easily intimidated...

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.170
...you're totally mistaken!

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:07.780
Ayukawa!

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:15.510
Sempai!

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:29.070
Mommy...

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:30.860
Mommy!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.200
Mommy!

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:43.780
Oh No!

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:50.520
There!

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:57.280
Now, just what's going on here, Kasuga?!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.440
Wh... Oh, er...

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:03.150
Well, you know... like they say,
"Cats ought to be with other cats!"

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.200
What?!

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:18.070
"Mommy!"

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:24.740
"Mommy!"

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:45.460
Who knew that it was just
an accidental resemblance...

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:47.410
An accidental resemblance among cats?!

00:22:58.750 --> 00:23:01.830
Keep your chin up, okay?
Until you find her...

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:04.760
...Ms. Madoka here will take care of you
like a mother would.

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:07.680
Ayukawa...

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:12.050
Oh! I love Jingoro too, you know!

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:14.070
Jingoro!

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:24.500
At that moment... I felt
really envious of Jingoro...

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:40.430
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:44.680
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:49.020
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:53.250
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.250 --> 00:24:01.130
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.130 --> 00:24:10.630
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:18.440
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:27.120
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:36.830
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.830 --> 00:24:45.210
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.210 --> 00:24:49.540
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.540 --> 00:24:53.880
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:58.180
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.180 --> 00:25:02.520
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.520 --> 00:25:07.350
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.620 --> 00:25:16.700
Kurumi's fallen in love!
That royal pig has lost her appetite...

00:25:16.700 --> 00:25:19.110
...and gotten all mellow and sentimental, gazing at the night sky!

00:25:19.110 --> 00:25:21.010
Exactly who did she fall for?!

00:25:21.010 --> 00:25:23.410
What?! Hayami,
the guy from the Soccer Club?!

00:25:23.410 --> 00:25:26.680
Why, that's the guy who
sent Ayukawa a love letter!

00:25:26.680 --> 00:25:30.830
Next time: "A Tender Little Story!
Kurumi's First Love - Chapter 'Hell' "
